   "text": "Independently reproduce at minimum: (1) the former two-promoted/one-lost schedule no longer loses either node; (2) absolute --ci-summary and --include markers are never read or disclosed and cause nonzero; (3) static and raced escaping-link probes refuse; (4) committed task changes appear using the recorded frozen base; (5) M0-T066 graph evidence starts from its implementation; (6) actual Unit E provenance and call identity appear; (7) a concurrency task routes high/ambiguous rather than silently false; (8) a real advisory digest contributes useful bounded context; (9) status projection still catches uncommitted changes; (10) the exact clean-checkout e2e command exits 0 twice; (11) expanded index parity remains byte-identical; (12) all pre-existing context/index/graph/memory/view/benchmark/projection and routing suites remain green.",
